# Gitleaks allowlist - false positives only.
#
# Every allowlist row MUST have a `# Reason:` line directly above it.
# Gitleaks ignores comment lines, so the reason stays in the file without
# changing the fingerprint it matches.
#
# Format:
#   # Reason: <why this finding is a false positive>
#   <file>:<rule-id>:<line>
#
# Add a row only after confirming the finding is a false positive. Never
# allowlist a live credential: rotate it, remove it from the working tree,
# and purge it from history instead.
